---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility — Rooted Community"
  description="Rooted Community is committed to making this website usable for everyone."
>
  <section class="container section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Statement</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Accessibility</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="container section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Rooted Community is committed to making this website usable for everyone, including
        people who use assistive technology. We aim to meet the
        <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA
        </a>
        across the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you encounter content that is difficult to access, please let us know. We treat
        accessibility issues as bugs and prioritize fixes accordingly. The fastest way to
        reach us is through the
        <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>
      <h2>What we work to provide</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic HTML structure with ARIA landmarks for assistive technology</li>
        <li>Keyboard-navigable interfaces with visible focus indicators</li>
        <li>Sufficient color contrast in line with WCAG 2.2 AA</li>
        <li>Descriptive alternative text on meaningful images</li>
        <li>Animations that respect <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code></li>
        <li>Content that scales cleanly when zoomed up to 200%</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Known gaps</h2>
      <p>
        This site is in active development. Some pages have less-than-final structure or
        placeholder imagery. As we ship each page, we test against axe-core and manual
        screen-reader checks. If something specific isn't working for you, please let us know.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp( 2.75rem, 6vw, 5rem );
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    margin-top: var( --space-3 );
  }
</style>
